# BYE - Exit cpmsim

```text
BYE [/Y]
```

## Return to host

Save your work and return to the CP/M prompt before entering BYE. Press
Y at the confirmation to exit the emulator. N or Enter cancels. BYE is
supplied on the cpmsim System disk.

## Batch exit

```text
BYE /Y
```

This skips confirmation. Put it last in a procedure that should shut
down cpmsim after all file operations have finished.
